\par \fs24 This \ul Accounting\plain\fs24 {\v User_Accounting} menu item \b Delete Up To\plain\fs24  displays the 'Delete Session records' dialog
\par The dialog displays the dates of the first and last session records and number of records in the database
\par 
\par E.g. To delete all session records up to (but not including) the 23rd March 1998 enter the date ( 23-Mar-98) and press OK.
