{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} Image Directory Change Privilege}
\pard\tx355 {\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} Image_Directory_Change_Privilege}
\fs36 Image Directory Change Privilege
\par \pard\tx355 \fs24 
\par \pard\tx355 This privilege is part of the \ul User Profile\plain\fs24 {\v User_Profile}.
\par \pard\tx355 
\par \pard\tx355 If this priviledge is present the User may change his \ul Current Image Directory\plain\fs24 {\v Current_Image_Directory} to any directory.
