\par \pard\tx355 
\par \pard\tx355 If a User does not have the \ul Image Directory Change Privilege\plain\fs24 {\v Image_Directory_Change_Privilege} he may not set his current Image directory higher in the directory tree than this directory.
\par \page
{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} Initial User Directory}
{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} Initial_User_Directory}
