\par \fs24 
\par When a User logs on for the first time the User Directory will be set to this directory specification.
\par 
\par If a User does not have the \ul User Directory Change Privilege\plain\fs24 {\v User_Directory_Change_Privilege} he may not set his current User directory higher in the directory tree than this directory.
